#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:381
msgid "Configuring the properties of the oval"
msgstr "Konfigurera ovalens egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:383
msgid ""
"The properties of the oval can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the oval and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra ovalens egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över ovalen och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

